Implement a **two-tier progressive search** that returns instant results via Model2Vec (potion-multilingual-128M), then refines rankings in the background using a warm transformer (all-MiniLM-L6-v2) via the daemon.

## Architecture

```
User Query
    │
    ├──→ [potion-multilingual-128M] ──→ Results in ~1ms (display immediately)
    │         (in-process)
    │
    └──→ [all-MiniLM-L6-v2 daemon] ──→ Refined scores in ~130ms
              (warm process)                  │
                                              ▼
                                      Smooth re-rank animation
```

## Core Components

### 1. TwoTierSearcher

```rust
pub struct TwoTierSearcher {
    /// Fast embedder for instant results (Model2Vec, in-process)
    fast: Model2VecEmbedder,
    /// Quality embedder via daemon (MiniLM, warm process)  
    quality: DaemonClient,
    /// Blend factor for combining scores (0.0 = fast only, 1.0 = quality only)
    blend_factor: f32,
}

pub enum SearchPhase {
    /// Initial fast results (sub-millisecond)
    Initial { results: Vec<SearchResult>, latency_ms: f64 },
    /// Refined results from transformer
    Refined { results: Vec<SearchResult>, latency_ms: f64, changes: RankChanges },
    /// Refinement failed, keeping initial results
    RefinementFailed { error: String },
}

pub struct RankChanges {
    /// Items that moved up
    promoted: Vec<(usize, usize)>,  // (old_rank, new_rank)
    /// Items that moved down
    demoted: Vec<(usize, usize)>,
    /// Items unchanged
    stable: usize,
}
```

### 2. Async Search Stream

```rust
impl TwoTierSearcher {
    /// Returns a stream of search phases
    pub fn search(&self, query: &str, limit: usize) -> impl Stream<Item = SearchPhase> {
        async_stream::stream! {
            let start = Instant::now();

            // Phase 1: Fast results (blocking, but sub-ms)
            let fast_emb = self.fast.embed(query)?;
            let initial = self.rank_documents(&fast_emb, limit);
            yield SearchPhase::Initial { 
                results: initial.clone(),
                latency_ms: start.elapsed().as_secs_f64() * 1000.0,
            };

            // Phase 2: Quality refinement (async, ~130ms)
            let refine_start = Instant::now();
            match self.quality.embed(&[query], Some("all-MiniLM-L6-v2"), None).await {
                Ok(embeddings) => {
                    let quality_emb = &embeddings[0];
                    let refined = self.rank_documents(quality_emb, limit);
                    let changes = compute_rank_changes(&initial, &refined);

                    yield SearchPhase::Refined {
                        results: refined,
                        latency_ms: refine_start.elapsed().as_secs_f64() * 1000.0,
                        changes,
                    };
                }
                Err(e) => {
                    yield SearchPhase::RefinementFailed { 
                        error: e.to_string() 
                    };
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

### 3. CLI Flags

```
xf search "query" --two-tier        # Enable progressive refinement (default if daemon running)
xf search "query" --fast-only       # Skip refinement, use potion only
xf search "query" --quality-only    # Wait for transformer results (no progressive)
```

